{"id":"2550b574056caca5","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Lp Seminorm","display":"df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Lp Seminorm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Lp Seminorm","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-lp-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Lp Seminorm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb K^X\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb K^X\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in[0,\\infty]\">\\(r\\in[0,\\infty]\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}lp\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb K,p,f,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))\\land r=\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}lp\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb K,p,f,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))\\land r=\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC measure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)$ and $\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in[1,\\infty)$, $f\\in\\mathbb K^X$, $r\\in[0,\\infty]$, and $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb K^X","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal A),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb K)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}lp\\text{-}seminorm} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LpSeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb K,p,f,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\